version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-10-02"
abstract: >-
  C++14 High-Level Synthesis research prototype of OES-32 telemetry-triage checks
  (coherence floor, EVEN/ODD symmetry, FOLD8 ring balance) with a portable g++
  testbench. Profile A sidecar to the normative residual in oes32-residual
  (ADR-001). Version 0.2.0 adds a streaming AXI4-Stream triage kernel
  (oes32_triage_accelerator) with an adaptive, clamped fixed-point gain, verified
  only by a g++ testbench against a double-precision golden model on SYNTHETIC
  stimuli. AMD ZCU111 is a TARGET; FPGA synthesis, timing and board runs are UNRUN.
keywords:
  - oes32
  - hls
  - vitis-hls
  - fpga
  - cpp
  - axi4-stream
  - fixed-point
